
---
const services = [
  {
    number: "01",
    title: "Discovery & Problem Definition",
    description: "Getting beneath the surface to understand the real challenge, ask better questions, and identify what matters most."
  },
  {
    number: "02",
    title: "Strategic Thinking & Decision Support",
    description: "Bringing structure to complexity, connecting evidence and insight, and helping leaders make thoughtful, informed decisions."
  },
  {
    number: "03",
    title: "Facilitation & Stakeholder Engagement",
    description: "Bringing people and perspectives together to build shared understanding and support better decisions."
  },
  {
    number: "04",
    title: "Change & Implementation",
    description: "Turning insight into action through practical planning, thoughtful change, and sustainable implementation."
  }
];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="Causeway Decision Quality Consultancy helps organizations navigate complexity, improve decision quality, and move forward with clarity." />
    <title>Causeway | Think deeper. Change smarter.</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="header">
      <a href="#home" class="logo">
        <img src="/causeway-logo.png" alt="Causeway Decision Quality Consultancy" />
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#thinking">The Thinking</a>
        <a href="#philosophy">Philosophy</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#approach">How I Work</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <!-- HERO -->

      <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>

        <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">Clarity in complexity</p>
          <h1>Think deeper.<br />Change smarter.</h1>

          <p>
            Better decisions begin with better questions.<br />
            Causeway helps organizations navigate complexity, uncover what matters, and move forward with clarity and confidence.
          </p>

          <a href="#contact" class="cta">Let's start a conversation</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- INTRODUCTION -->

      <section class="intro section" id="about">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">A thoughtful way forward</p>
          <h2>Find the cause.<br />Find the way.</h2>

          <p>
            Better decisions start with understanding the problem
            an organization is actually trying to solve. Through
            disciplined discovery, evidence-informed thinking, and
            thoughtful stakeholder engagement, Causeway helps
            organizations make sense of complexity and move toward
            better outcomes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- THE THINKING -->

      <section class="thinking section" id="thinking">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">The Thinking Behind the Work</p>
          <h2>Better questions lead to better decisions.</h2>

          <div class="bio">
            <p>
              Causeway was founded by Krista Chapman, whose perspective
              on organizational challenges has been shaped by experience
              at every level of complex organizations, from frontline
              healthcare to senior executive leadership.
            </p>

            <p>
              Beginning her career on the frontlines of healthcare,
              Krista developed a deep appreciation for the people,
              relationships, and systems that shape care partnerships.
              Over the past 15+ years, she has worked across clinical
              practice, operations, quality, and organizational leadership,
              bringing a practical, systems-level perspective to
              complex challenges.
            </p>

            <p>
              Having worked across frontline practice and senior
              executive leadership, Krista understands the importance
              of bringing together the perspectives of people who
              shape, deliver, and experience services every day.
              She believes improvement happens when people are genuinely
              heard, different forms of expertise are valued, and
              decisions reflect the experiences of those most affected.
              It requires creating the conditions for open dialogue,
              shared understanding, and genuine partnership, while
              connecting organizational priorities with the realities
              of everyday practice and experience.
            </p>

            <p>
              Throughout her career, Krista has worked alongside
              executive teams, multidisciplinary groups, and frontline
              professionals across Canada and the United States.
              Her experience includes navigating complex operational
              environments, leading organizational improvement
              initiatives, advancing quality and performance, and
              helping organizations make sense of change. She remains
              actively engaged in the healthcare leadership community
              as a member of the Vancouver Island Chapter Executive
              of the Canadian College of Health Leaders.
            </p>

            <p>
              A registered nurse, Certified Health Executive (CHE),
              and Master of Precision Health (MPrecH), Krista brings
              together practical experience, systems-level thinking,
              evidence-informed decision-making, and an appreciation
              for the human side of organizational change.
            </p>

            <p>
              Through Causeway, Krista works alongside organizations
              and leaders to navigate complexity, uncover what matters,
              and find a clearer path forward.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- PHILOSOPHY -->

      <section class="philosophy section" id="philosophy">
        <div class="section-inner">

          <p class="eyebrow">What Guides the Work</p>
          <h2>The Causeway Philosophy</h2>

          <div class="philosophy-intro">
            <p>
              Organizations are filled with smart people, good intentions,
              and a desire to make things better.
            </p>

            <p>
              Yet many still struggle to create lasting change because
              they move from problem to solution too quickly.
            </p>

            <p class="philosophy-emphasis">
              We believe improvement begins with understanding.
            </p>

            <p>
              We help organizations slow down enough to:
            </p>

            <ul class="philosophy-list">
              <li>Engage the people closest to the work.</li>
              <li>Ask better questions.</li>
              <li>Understand what is truly driving the challenge.</li>
              <li>Use evidence to create clarity.</li>
              <li>Make decisions with confidence.</li>
            </ul>

            <blockquote class="philosophy-quote">
              Even the best solution cannot succeed if we never truly
              understood the problem.
            </blockquote>

            <p>
              The goal goes beyond simply solving today's challenges.
              It is to help organizations build the confidence,
              capability, and culture to make better decisions long
              after we're gone.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mission">
            <p class="eyebrow">Mission</p>
            <p class="mission-statement">
              We improve the quality of organizational decisions through
              disciplined discovery, evidence-informed thinking, and
              thoughtful stakeholder engagement.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pillars">
            <p class="eyebrow">Three Pillars</p>
            <h2>How the work takes shape.</h2>

            <div class="pillar-grid">

              <article class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar-number">01</span>
                <h3>Intentional</h3>
                <p class="pillar-tagline">Understand before we act.</p>

                <p>
                  Together, we uncover the right problem before designing
                  the solution.
                </p>

                <p>
                  We create space for discovery, curiosity, and open
                  dialogue to understand what is truly happening,
                  not just what appears on the surface.
                </p>

                <p class="pillar-highlight">
                  We take the time to ask the right people the right
                  questions before finding the right answer.
                </p>
              </article>

              <article class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar-number">02</span>
                <h3>Impactful</h3>
                <p class="pillar-tagline">Focus on what creates change.</p>

                <p>
                  We help organizations prioritize improvements that
                  positively affect outcomes for people, teams,
                  organizations, and systems.
                </p>

                <p>
                  Through evidence-informed thinking and stakeholder
                  engagement, we focus energy where it matters most.
                </p>

                <p class="pillar-highlight">
                  Better decisions lead to better outcomes.
                </p>
              </article>

              <article class="pillar">
                <span class="pillar-number">03</span>
                <h3>Sustainable</h3>
                <p class="pillar-tagline">Build capacity, not dependency.</p>

                <p>
                  The goal is not to create reliance on external expertise.
                </p>

                <p>
                  We help organizations develop the confidence, capability,
                  and culture to continue solving complex challenges long
                  after an engagement ends.
                </p>

                <p class="pillar-highlight">
                  The best measure of success is when organizations no
                  longer need us.
                </p>
              </article>

            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="values">
            <p class="eyebrow">Core Values</p>
            <h2>What matters in how we work.</h2>

            <div class="values-grid">

              <article class="value">
                <h3>Every voice matters</h3>
                <p>
                  The people closest to the work have essential insights.
                  Better decisions come from including the perspectives
                  of those who deliver, receive, and experience services
                  and systems every day.
                </p>
              </article>

              <article class="value">
                <h3>Psychological safety enables better decisions</h3>
                <p>
                  People contribute their best thinking when they feel
                  respected, included, and safe to challenge assumptions,
                  express different perspectives, and speak openly.
                </p>
              </article>

              <article class="value">
                <h3>Evidence creates clarity</h3>
                <p>
                  Data and evidence create shared understanding. They help
                  organizations learn, improve, and make decisions based
                  on what is known rather than assumptions.
                </p>
              </article>

              <article class="value">
                <h3>Systems over symptoms</h3>
                <p>
                  We look beyond what is visible and seek to understand
                  the conditions, relationships, and structures that
                  create challenges.
                </p>
              </article>

              <article class="value">
                <h3>Build capacity, not dependency</h3>
                <p>
                  We leave organizations stronger, more confident, and
                  better equipped to understand and solve future challenges.
                </p>
              </article>

            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- SERVICES -->

      <section class="services section" id="services">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">How Causeway Helps</p>

          <h2>Make sense of the messy.<br />Move toward what matters.</h2>

          <div class="service-grid">
            {services.map((service) => (
              <article class="service">
                <span class="number">{service.number}</span>
                <h3>{service.title}</h3>
                <p>{service.description}</p>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- APPROACH -->

      <section class="approach section" id="approach">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">How I Work</p>

          <h2>Comfortable in the grey.<br />Focused on the way forward.</h2>

          <p>
            I bring curiosity, structure, and an open mind to complex
            challenges. I listen carefully, ask thoughtful questions,
            explore different perspectives, and work alongside people
            to uncover what matters.
          </p>

          <p>
            The goal isn't simply to find an answer. It's to make better
            decisions about what comes next.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CONTACT -->

      <section class="contact section" id="contact">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p>

          <h2>Have a complex challenge?<br />Let's work through it.</h2>

          <p>
            Whether you're navigating a difficult decision, exploring
            a new direction, or trying to make sense of a complex
            challenge, I'd welcome the conversation.
          </p>

          <a href="mailto:kchapman@causewayconsultancy.ca" class="cta">
            kchapman@causewayconsultancy.ca
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Causeway Decision Quality Consultancy Inc.</p>
      <p>Think deeper. Change smarter.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --slate: #23364A;
    --coastal: #668A9A;
    --stone: #C2BBA8;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--slate);
    background: var(--white);
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 18px 7%;
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .logo img {
    display: block;
    width: 190px;
    height: auto;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    color: var(--slate);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--coastal);
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 620px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 90px 10%;
    background-image: url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1448375240586-882707db888b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2400&q=85");
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      rgba(24, 42, 55, 0.82),
      rgba(24, 42, 55, 0.35)
    );
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero .eyebrow {
    color: var(--white);
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 76px);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 4.5vw, 56px);
  }

  .hero p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 13px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--white);
    color: var(--white);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta:hover {
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--slate);
  }

  .section {
    padding: 100px 10%;
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .intro p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .thinking {
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .thinking h2 {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 35px;
  }

  .bio {
    max-width: 850px;
  }

  .bio p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }

  /* Philosophy */

  .philosophy {
    background: #F5F2EA;
  }

  .philosophy-intro {
    max-width: 850px;
  }

  .philosophy-intro p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }

  .philosophy-emphasis {
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 26px !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
    margin: 32px 0 !important;
  }

  .philosophy-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 20px 0 35px;
  }

  .philosophy-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding: 10px 0 10px 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(35, 54, 74, 0.12);
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .philosophy-list li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .philosophy-quote {
    margin: 45px 0;
    padding: 25px 0 25px 28px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--coastal);
    color: var(--slate);
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 27px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Mission */

  .mission {
    margin-top: 90px;
    padding: 55px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--stone);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--stone);
  }

  .mission .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .mission-statement {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 35px);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Three Pillars */

  .pillars {
    margin-top: 100px;
  }

  .pillars > h2,
  .values > h2 {
    margin-bottom: 45px;
  }

  .pillar-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .pillar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 32px 26px;
    background: var(--white);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--coastal);
  }

  .pillar-number {
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .pillar h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 29px;
  }

  .pillar-tagline {
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }

  .pillar > p:not(.pillar-tagline) {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .pillar .pillar-highlight {
    margin-top: auto !important;
    padding-top: 22px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--stone);
    color: var(--slate);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Core Values */

  .values {
    margin-top: 110px;
  }

  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0 65px;
  }

  .value {
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--stone);
  }

  .value h3 {
    font-size: 23px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .value p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .value:last-child {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    max-width: 490px;
  }

  /* Services */

  .service-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 65px 70px;
    margin-top: 75px;
  }

  .service {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--stone);
    padding-top: 28px;
  }

  .number {
    display: block;
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .service h3 {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .service p {
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* Approach */

  .approach {
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .approach p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }

  /* Contact */

  .contact {
    background: var(--slate);
    color: var(--white);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact .eyebrow {
    color: var(--stone);
  }

  .contact p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 30px;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  /* Footer */

  footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 22px 7%;
    background: #1B2B3B;
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  footer p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Mobile */

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pillar-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .pillar {
      padding: 30px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .logo img {
      width: 165px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px 18px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 560px;
      padding: 70px 8%;
      background-position: center;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 70px 8%;
    }

    .bio p {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .philosophy-intro p {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .philosophy-emphasis {
      font-size: 23px !important;
    }

    .philosophy-quote {
      font-size: 23px;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .mission {
      margin-top: 65px;
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .pillars {
      margin-top: 70px;
    }

    .pillar {
      padding: 25px;
    }

    .values {
      margin-top: 75px;
    }

    .values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .value:last-child {
      grid-column: auto;
      max-width: none;
    }

    .service-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      margin-top: 50px;
    }

    .number {
      font-size: 56px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .service h3 {
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .service p {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    footer {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 22px;
    }
  }
</style>
